intelligence is actually not fixed? It's something that could be developed. And what we find is that students love the idea of using their story to inspire future students who might go through the same trials and tribulations. So the intervention is not months or weeks long. It's intentionally short and efficient. So that way, adolescents have the chance to read the ideas, understand them, and internalize them,
