without it feeling like people are telling you what to think or telling you how to behave. What were the changes that you were able to measure when you administered this intervention? I know that you had a very large cohort of people you brought together and administered the intervention, and you came up with some pretty interesting results. Yeah, that's a great question.
而不会让人觉得别人在告诉你该怎么想或告诉你该怎么做。当你实施这项干预时，你能够测量到哪些变化？我知道你召集了一个非常庞大的群体来实施这项干预，并且得出了一些非常有趣的结果。是的，这是一个很好的问题。

